TypeScript source stays in this directory. Oxlint loads the tsdown build
under `tools/oxlint/dist/` (`anti-slop.mjs` and `anti-slop-effect.mjs`) so
plugins work on Node versions that cannot import `.ts` (this repo's Cloud
Agent image is Node 22.14; CI uses Node 24).

Rebuild with `pnpm turbo run build --filter=@getpie/oxlint`.
